        "fruit_eater"
      ],
      "source": "wikipedia",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spiny_turtle"
    },
    {
      "category": "conservation",
      "text": "Main threats: collecting for food and pets, and rainforest cleared for farms.",
      "source": "iucn"
    },
    {
      "category": "conservation",
      "text": "Its numbers dropped by 50 to 80% over the last 51 years.",
